--- stderr ---
error: a block in a bracket pair declaration head must be empty
  ┌─ tests/harness/errors/382_bracket_pair_block_parameter_parens.eu:3:3
  │
3 │ (⟦{k: kk, m}⟧): [kk, m]
  │   ^^^^^^^^^^
  │
  = a bracket pair always receives its items as a list, so its parameter is a name (`⟦ xs ⟧`) or a list pattern (`⟦ [x, y] ⟧`), not a block pattern
  = to destructure a single block item, put the block pattern in a list pattern: `⟦ [{m}] ⟧: m`
  = an empty block `⟦{}⟧: { :monad … }` declares a monadic bracket pair
